{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter New York, 1920 \u2014 a city pulsing with ambition, corruption, and deadly rivalries.<br>In <strong>Silent Authority: Blood &amp; Bourbon</strong>, every street is a prize, every deal a risk, and every ally a potential traitor. From the bustling docks of Brooklyn to the velvet-lit jazz clubs of Harlem, the city is a living organism\u2014breathing, changing, and waiting to be claimed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with nothing but ambition. Recruit loyal enforcers, seize rackets from the shadows, and weave your influence through the city\u2019s underbelly. Every move shapes your legend, drawing the eyes of rival kingpins, crooked politicians, and watchful lawmen. In this world, power isn\u2019t earned\u2014it\u2019s taken, one brutal step at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending ruthless empire-building, cinematic real-time combat, and cutthroat underworld politics, <i>Silent Authority</i> delivers a living, breathing city where no two crime dynasties rise the same way. Territories are taken and lost in blood, alliances forged in smoke-filled backrooms and broken in gunfire, and your road to power will be paved with bribes, bullets, and spilled bourbon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/8285d71417872af4cb8b2545c9a85dce.avif?t=1763400219\" width=1600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/718dd038ce75406c8e5b2a735d639b8b.poster.avif?t=1763400219\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/718dd038ce75406c8e5b2a735d639b8b.webm?t=1763400219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/718dd038ce75406c8e5b2a735d639b8b.mp4?t=1763400219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tarz\u0131n\u0131 kur: \u00f6zellikleri payla\u015ft\u0131r, avantajlar\u0131 a\u00e7; g\u00f6zda\u011f\u0131 veren duru\u015f, sa\u011flam beden, \u00e7abuk toparlanma, ekstra silah yuvas\u0131 ve geni\u015f ganimet kapasitesi gibi yollarla sahada \u00fcst\u00fcnl\u00fck kur. Her tercih olaylarda s\u00f6z\u00fc ge\u00e7en bir profil ya da \u00e7at\u0131\u015fmada daha dayan\u0131kl\u0131 bir duru\u015f yarat\u0131r\u2014oyun stilin burada \u015fekillenir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/58ea7ada1f6fffda6b1677084be2c65e.avif?t=1763400219\" width=1600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/bf12545ddd9698c2c52c1b121c2a2883.poster.avif?t=1763400219\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/bf12545ddd9698c2c52c1b121c2a2883.webm?t=1763400219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/bf12545ddd9698c2c52c1b121c2a2883.mp4?t=1763400219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dinamik olaylar s\u00fcrekli nabz\u0131 y\u00fckseltir: ihbarlar, denetim bask\u0131nlar\u0131, rakip ittifak teklifleri, k\u00f6stebek \u015f\u00fcpheleri. R\u00fc\u015fvet ver, g\u00f6zda\u011f\u0131 ver ya da g\u00f6r\u00fcnmez ol; her yol gelirlerini, sokak sayg\u0131nl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ve ekibin g\u00fcvenini farkl\u0131 \u015fekilde etkiler. Y\u00fcksek kazan\u00e7 genelde y\u00fcksek Bask\u0131 ile gelir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/05b9804a2b4d931a898977bd789fa524.avif?t=1763400219\" width=1600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/d4d2aee9da3e51e44e82d1b7a543307f.poster.avif?t=1763400219\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/d4d2aee9da3e51e44e82d1b7a543307f.webm?t=1763400219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/d4d2aee9da3e51e44e82d1b7a543307f.mp4?t=1763400219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paravan i\u015fletmeni y\u00f6net: m\u00fcd\u00fcr ata, seviyeyi y\u00fckselt; Cost / Laundering / Earnings ak\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 g\u00fcnl\u00fck\u2011haftal\u0131k\u2011ayl\u0131k takip et.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tek t\u0131kla Smuggling ba\u015flat, k\u00e2rl\u0131l\u0131k risk dengesini iyi ayarla ve operasyon zincirini b\u00fcy\u00fct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restoran, terzi, ayakkab\u0131c\u0131 gibi \u00f6nlerden kasay\u0131 b\u00fcy\u00fct; her y\u00fckseltme yeni f\u0131rsatlar ve verim art\u0131\u015f\u0131 getirir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/7a8a95d5f0d562516955f839de8628d0.avif?t=1763400219\" width=1600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragra