paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/8285d71417872af4cb8b2545c9a85dce.avif?t=1763400219\" width=1600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/718dd038ce75406c8e5b2a735d639b8b.poster.avif?t=1763400219\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/718dd038ce75406c8e5b2a735d639b8b.webm?t=1763400219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/718dd038ce75406c8e5b2a735d639b8b.mp4?t=1763400219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tarz\u0131n\u0131 kur: \u00f6zellikleri payla\u015ft\u0131r, avantajlar\u0131 a\u00e7; g\u00f6zda\u011f\u0131 veren duru\u015f, sa\u011flam beden, \u00e7abuk toparlanma, ekstra silah yuvas\u0131 ve geni\u015f ganimet kapasitesi gibi yollarla sahada \u00fcst\u00fcnl\u00fck kur. Her tercih olaylarda s\u00f6z\u00fc ge\u00e7en bir profil ya da \u00e7at\u0131\u015fmada daha dayan\u0131kl\u0131 bir duru\u015f yarat\u0131r\u2014oyun stilin burada \u015fekillenir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/58ea7ada1f6fffda6b1677084be2c65e.avif?t=1763400219\" width=1600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/bf12545ddd9698c2c52c1b121c2a2883.poster.avif?t=1763400219\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://sh